      "tier": 3,
      "text": "Settle the word order before you commit to any pair. The intro hands you sìì jaŋgidḕ = \"school\" for free: one of those two words must name a building and the other must name the activity that happens in it. Decide from the shape of phrases such as \"sauce spoon\" and \"source of water\" whether Nizaa puts the main noun first or last, then apply that single order to all 21 entries.",
